# Allowlist: ignore everything at the top level, then un-ignore only the files
# this repository is meant to contain. This keeps users' NetSuite scripts,
# zips, and unredacted screenshots from being committed by accident.
# To add a new top-level file or folder, add an "!" line for it below.
/*

# Repository files
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/SKILL.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md

# GitHub config (issue templates)
!/.github/

# Documentation: Markdown files and the images folder only
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/*.md
!/docs/images/

# Never commit zips or scripts exported from a NetSuite File Cabinet,
# even inside an allowed folder
*.zip
